{"id":"wb-7-1244","name":"澧州文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"澧州文庙","text":"澧州文庙，又称澧县文庙，原名澧州学宫，位于湖南省澧县县城西区的澧阳镇古城西路，始建于宋朝，明初迁建于现址，现存建筑系1841年（道光二十一年）至1844年(道光二十四年)重建，2007年澧县文庙经过大的修缮。\n1959年公布为湖南省重点文物保护单位；2013年列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BE%A7%E5%B7%9E%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86786685,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86786685","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e48ccf9b37b04db8b8a23ded.jpg","title":"澧县文庙状元桥_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%BE%A7%E5%8E%BF%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99%E7%8A%B6%E5%85%83%E6%A1%A5_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/%E6%BE%A7%E5%8E%BF%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99%E7%8A%B6%E5%85%83%E6%A1%A5_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"涔水影人","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"澧县文庙状元桥","width":320,"height":240}}